---
// The Terms page: short, plain rules for using the list and an account (docs/DECISIONS.md D46). A plain-words default, not reviewed by a lawyer.
import LegalShell from '@/components/legal/LegalShell.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/config/site';
---

<LegalShell title="Terms" description="The plain rules for using Site Library." updated="11 November 2026">
	<p>
		{SITE.name} is free. By using it, or by signing in, you accept these rules. They are short on purpose.
	</p>

	<h2>What this is</h2>
	<p>
		A free list of websites, each reviewed, dated and scored by the owner, with the catch up front. The scores are the owner's judgement from reading
		each site's own pages. They are not advice, and they can be out of date. The date on each row says when it was checked.
	</p>

	<h2>No promises</h2>
	<p>
		The list, the scores and the links are provided as they are. We do not control the websites we list, and using them is your choice. We cannot
		promise the site is always available or free of mistakes.
	</p>

	<h2>Your account</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>You sign in with your own Google or GitHub account, and you keep that account safe.</li>
		<li>One person, one account. Please do not use scripts to create ratings or bookmarks.</li>
		<li>We may close an account that is used to abuse the site. You can delete yours at any time (see <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>).</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Ratings</h2>
	<p>
		A star rating is your own opinion of a website. Please rate honestly. Ratings are shown only as totals and averages, never with your name.
	</p>

	<h2>Written reviews</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>A written review is your own honest opinion of a website, in plain text of 10 to 600 characters, with no web addresses.</li>
		<li>Please do not post insults, threats, private information about anyone, spam or anything you do not have the right to say.</li>
		<li>Every new or changed review is read by the owner before it is shown. We may decline or remove a review, and we may close an account that keeps posting what these rules do not allow.</li>
		<li>An approved review is shown without your name. You can change or delete yours at any time.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Fairness</h2>
	<p>Rankings are never for sale. If a link or a listing is ever sponsored or earns money, it will be marked as such and will not change its score.</p>

	<h2>Corrections</h2>
	<p>
		If you run a website we list and something about it is wrong, message <a href={SITE.xUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer">@Adicrux on X</a>. We will
		check it and correct it.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes</h2>
	<p>We may change these rules or stop the service. The date at the top shows the latest change.</p>
</LegalShell>
